# Keeps secrets, caches and test output out of the build context and therefore out of every image layer (M10, D-110).
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.infra.example
!.env.compose.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
demo-videos
*.webm
docs/phase-reports
apps/web/e2e
